# Keys of bench.ts `Runner` (schemas.RunnerView: GET /runners runners[]), one per line; a trailing ? marks an optional (Go omitempty) key.
# Hosted platform (U1 UI). A top-level response adds "mode". Change with bench.ts and the Go type.
id
org_id
name
pool
labels
version
host
state
slots
running
running_slots
completed
token_id
token_prefix?
last_seen
registered_at
live
